          "text": " Baryagituuramu buhooro, bagyombekyemu amaju, bahingyemu emisiri y'emizaabibu. Ku ndita ebifubiro aha bantu abarikubagaya, abariba babeehinguririize, bo baryaguma bari buhooro. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA waabo.",
